<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-INDIA 194-2 V WEST INDIES - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 194-2 V WEST INDIES - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN, Guyana 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 194-2 at the close on the opening day of the fifth and final test against West Indies on Thursday.</p>
